<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ThermoLase upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ThermoLase upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer and Co analyst Leah Cann upgraded Thermolase Corp to buy from outperform, her office said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/4 at 21.</p>
</text>
